@startuml
title 外卖点餐与配送系统 组件图
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

package "客户端" {
  [顾客端] as CustomerUI
  [商家端] as MerchantUI
  [配送端] as RiderUI
  [管理端] as AdminUI
}

package "接入层" {
  [API 接口层] as API
}

package "业务服务" {
  [认证与权限服务] as AuthService
  [店铺服务] as StoreService
  [菜品与库存服务] as MenuService
  [购物车与下单服务] as OrderingService
  [订单与配送服务] as OrderDeliveryService
  [退款与售后服务] as RefundService
  [查询与统计服务] as StatsService
  [日志与审计服务] as LogService
}

package "数据层" {
  [数据访问 Repository] as Repo
  database "MySQL 数据库" as DB
  database "文件存储" as FS
}

[模拟支付] as Pay

CustomerUI --> API
MerchantUI --> API
RiderUI --> API
AdminUI --> API

API --> AuthService
API --> StoreService
API --> MenuService
API --> OrderingService
API --> OrderDeliveryService
API --> RefundService
API --> StatsService
API --> LogService

OrderingService --> MenuService : 校验/扣减/回补库存
OrderingService --> OrderDeliveryService : 创建订单/发起配送
OrderingService --> Pay : 模拟支付
OrderingService --> RefundService : 发起退款
RefundService --> OrderingService : 更新订单/回补库存
OrderDeliveryService ..> RefundService : 退款/补偿
RefundService ..> OrderDeliveryService : 查询配送状态
StoreService --> MenuService : 店铺与菜品归属
StatsService --> Repo
AuthService --> Repo
StoreService --> Repo
MenuService --> Repo
OrderingService --> Repo
OrderDeliveryService --> Repo
RefundService --> Repo
LogService --> Repo
MenuService --> FS : 菜品图片
OrderingService ..> LogService : 写日志
OrderDeliveryService ..> LogService : 写日志
RefundService ..> LogService : 写日志
AuthService ..> LogService : 写日志
StoreService ..> LogService : 写日志
MenuService ..> LogService : 写日志
Repo --> DB

note right of API : 统一鉴权、参数校验、路由
note bottom of Repo : 各服务通过 Repository 访问数据库
note bottom of OrderingService : 下单保存价格快照；重复提交返回原订单
note left of RefundService : 退款按状态计算；已取餐/已送达的配送费归骑手
@enduml
